        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the fall of Luken, <strong>Milford Heaven</strong> entered an age of peace and prosperity. The shadow that once haunted its streets vanished, and you — the legendary warrior — finally laid down your blade, basking in the glory of your triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But evil never truly dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deep beneath the city, a new threat begins to stir. Silent. Unseen. Hungry. The foundations of Milford Heaven tremble once more, and this time… you’re no longer the unstoppable force you once were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, a true hero never ignores the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time to dust off your armor, sharpen your blade, and descend into the darkness. Face hordes of savage orcs, cunning goblins, undead horrors, and ancient golems in visceral hack-and-slash combat. Reclaim your strength. Uncover the source of this rising evil. And prove that legends never fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Fast-paced action RPG combat</strong><br>🐉 <strong>Classic fantasy monsters and brutal bosses</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Upgradeable weapons, skills, and gear</strong><br>🏰 <strong>Dark dungeons, hidden secrets, and epic quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milford Heaven needs its savior once again.<br><strong>Destiny calls — and it won’t wait.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the fall of Luken, <strong>Milford Heaven</strong> entered an age of peace and prosperity. The shadow that once haunted its streets vanished, and you — the legendary warrior — finally laid down your blade, basking in the glory of your triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But evil never truly dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deep beneath the city, a new threat begins to stir. Silent. Unseen. Hungry. The foundations of Milford Heaven tremble once more, and this time… you’re no longer the unstoppable force you once were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, a true hero never ignores the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time to dust off your armor, sharpen your blade, and descend into the darkness. Face hordes of savage orcs, cunning goblins, undead horrors, and ancient golems in visceral hack-and-slash combat. Reclaim your strength. Uncover the source of this rising evil. And prove that legends never fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Fast-paced action RPG combat</strong><br>🐉 <strong>Classic fantasy monsters and brutal bosses</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Upgradeable weapons, skills, and gear</strong><br>🏰 <strong>Dark dungeons, hidden secrets, and epic quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milford Heaven needs its savior once again.<br><strong>Destiny calls — and it won’t wait.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
